d>\n      <td>72,562</td>\n      <td>60,572</td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>Category 5: Waste generated in operations</strong></td>\n      <td>1,416</td>\n      <td>1,571</td>\n      <td>1,342</td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>Category 6: Business travel</strong></td>\n      <td>36,032</td>\n      <td>17,132</td>\n      <td>8,633</td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>Category 7: Employee commuting</strong></td>\n      <td>45,255</td>\n      <td>23,019</td>\n      <td>14,990</td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>Category 8: Upstream leased assets</strong></td>\n      <td>70,360</td>\n      <td>45,931</td>\n      <td>32,952</td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>External assurance</strong></td>\n      <td colspan="4"><u>Report of Independent Accountants</u> for select metrics for FY25, FY24, and FY23.<br>GRI 2-5<br>UNGC G13</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n1 In accordance with the GHG Protocol, we report biogenic emissions separately from Scope 1 emissions. NVIDIA FY25 biogenic emissions were 26 mt CO2e. FY25 biogenic emissions are not subject to assurance.\n\nNVIDIA Sustainability | Sustainability Indicators | 29\n\n--- PAGE 29 END ---\n\n\n\n--- PAGE 30 START ---\n\nMessage From Our CEO | Introduction | Energy, Efficiency, and Climate | People, Diversity, and Inclusion | Product Value Chain | Responsible Business | Sustainability Indicators | <img>house icon</img>\n\n# Energy, Efficiency, and Climate\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Metric</th>\n      <th>FY25</th>\n      <th>FY24</th>\n      <th>FY23</th>\n      <th>Reference Indicator</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>GHG emissions intensity (Scope 1 and 2 mtCO₂e/$M revenue)</td>\n      <td>0.1</td>\n      <td>0.9</td>\n      <td>2.6</td>\n      <td>GRI 305-4</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Reduction of GHG emissions</td>\n      <td><a hre